# What Prettier must not touch.
#
# Two categories. Things nobody wrote — dependencies, lockfiles, compiled
# output — and things written as prose, where a formatter reflowing a paragraph
# is a worse diff than the one it fixed.

# --- not written here -------------------------------------------------------

node_modules/
vendor/
build/
tools/
.claude/
package-lock.json
composer.lock
languages/
*.min.js
*.min.css

# --- prose ------------------------------------------------------------------

# README.md and CHANGELOG.md are read on wordpress.org as much as in the repo,
# and docs/ is hand-wrapped so the diffs stay readable. Prettier's markdown
# printer would rewrap every paragraph it touched, which turns a one-word edit
# into a forty-line change.
*.md
readme.txt

# --- not JavaScript ---------------------------------------------------------

# Twig, and PHP-CS-Fixer's business.
*.twig
*.php
